https://www.alissa-ia.ga/*    https://alissaia.com/:splat        301!
http://alissa-ia.ga/*         https://alissaia.com/:splat        301!
http://www.alissa-ia.ga/*     https://alissaia.com/:splat        301!

# www -> sans www
https://www.alissaia.com/*    https://alissaia.com/:splat        301!
http://www.alissaia.com/*     https://alissaia.com/:splat        301!
http://alissaia.com/*         https://alissaia.com/:splat        301!

